  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A solid is floating in a&nbsp;liquid with some fraction of its volume submerged. If for two different temperatures&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>, the fractions of the volume of the solid submerged in the liquid are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;respectively, then the&nbsp;coefficient of volume expansion of the liquid is [Assume that the expansion of the solid is negligible]</p>\r",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "7CdsC",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "8elYj",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "oFhOW",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>",
